can understand, but--

512
00:52:49,530 --> 00:52:52,620
Anyway, fate stepped in
with that car accident...

513
00:52:52,700 --> 00:52:54,910
and took football out of the equation.

514
00:52:55,040 --> 00:52:57,960
And everyone lived happily ever after.

515
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:01,630
Sort of.

516
00:53:01,710 --> 00:53:04,380
