518
00:53:16,850 --> 00:53:18,810
Ladies and gentlemen--

519
00:53:30,570 --> 00:53:32,530
In the first half--

520
00:54:01,730 --> 00:54:04,270
A 737 crashes on takeoff--

521
00:54:04,360 --> 00:54:07,280
172 die, no survivors.

522
00:54:07,400 --> 00:54:11,780
A hotel fire downtown--
211 die, no survivors.

523
00:54:11,860 --> 00:54:15,790
An Eastrail train derails
7 1/2 miles outside the city--

524
00:54:15,910 --> 00:54:17,870
131 die...

525
00:54:18,000 --> 00:54:20,040
one survivor.

526
00:54:20,160 --> 00:54:22,460
He is unharmed.

527
00:54:22,540 --> 00:54:25,460
I've spoken with your husband
about his survival.

528
00:54:25,550 --> 00:54:28,380
