Raise your arms, please.

542
00:55:54,680 --> 00:55:56,640
Come on, raise them up.

543
00:55:56,760 --> 00:55:58,970
I just got here, man.

544
00:56:09,570 --> 00:56:11,610
Can I put my hands down now?

545
00:56:17,370 --> 00:56:19,330
Can I go?

546
00:56:20,490 --> 00:56:22,450
Yeah.

547
00:56:24,040 --> 00:56:26,000
Hope you find them.

548
00:56:35,300 --> 00:56:39,600
- Yo, Dunn.
- Yeah.

549
00:56:39,680 --> 00:56:42,680
